  LocationName: Red Rocket Gas Station
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: 'You decided to take some time to pick over the Red Rocket stop.
    Its a relatively large gas station, with enough room to fit three large cargo
    trucks at the same time. The inside of the building itself is relatively small,
    only having a room to hold a variety of merchandise and a small employee room
    in the back. '
